remoterig (1.1.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * The Android manifest is generated from a template, so the APK carries the project version instead of a hardcoded 1.0.0
  * Fixed the Windows build: the Hamlib version is read through rig_version()
    rather than the exported hamlib_version variable, which needs dllimport
    and left an unresolved symbol at link time
  * The Windows installer takes its version from CMakeLists.txt instead of a
    hardcoded 1.0.0

